#: templates/ai_fill_bulk.html:60
msgid ""
"AI Fill for many games at once. The AI fills each game's empty fields, "
"such as genre, release dates and copies sold, the same way the AI Fill "
"button on a game's page does, and saves them straight to the game. Games "
"AI Fill has already done are skipped, so a second run only does the rest."
msgstr ""
"Ukuzalisa nge-AI kwimidlalo emininzi ngaxeshanye. I-AI izalisa iindawo "
"ezingenanto zomdlalo ngamnye, ezinjengohlobo, imihla yokukhutshwa kunye "
"neekopi ezithengisiweyo, ngendlela efanayo neqhosha elithi Ukuzalisa nge-"
"AI kwiphepha lomdlalo, kwaye izigcina ngqo emdlalweni. Imidlalo esele "
"yenziwe Ukuzalisa nge-AI iyatsitywa, ngoko ukuqhuba kwesibini kwenza "
"okuseleyo kuphela."

#: templates/ai_fill_bulk.html:61
msgid ""
"Your AI provider charges for each game. With Claude Haiku 5.5 and web "
"search on, a game costs at most about 5 US cents."
msgstr ""
"Umboneleli wakho we-AI uhlawulisa umdlalo ngamnye. NgeClaude Haiku 5.5 "
"kunye nokukhangela kwiwebhu kuvuliwe, umdlalo ubiza kungenakugqithisa "
"malunga neesenti ezi-5 zaseMelika."

#: templates/ai_fill_bulk.html:63
msgid "Fields to fill"
msgstr "Iindawo ezizaliswayo"

#: templates/ai_fill_bulk.html:64
msgid ""
"Only the fields switched on are filled, and only games with one of them "
"empty are counted. Fewer fields cost less."
msgstr ""
"Zizaliswa kuphela iindawo ezivuliweyo, kwaye kubalwa kuphela imidlalo "
"enenye yazo engenanto. Iindawo ezimbalwa ziza kubiza kancinci."

#: templates/ai_fill_bulk.html:66
